#: ../../source/docs/common-nooploop.rst:9 6de70408240c4f32ae672911d602fb5c
#: a872704409a1490abc34e74395f90d96 aab62595b6104dfd91eee29738865e4f
#: d35b2047df3242fc9f29f1f577246058 fa6731890ea24c859e0c3f68b27f3206
msgid ""
"This article explains how a `Nooploop <https://www.nooploop.com/en/>`__ "
"system based on UWB(Ultra Wide Band) technology can be used as a short-range"
" substitute for a GPS allowing position control modes like Loiter, PosHold, "
"RTL, Auto indoors."
msgstr ""
"本文介绍如何使用基于 UWB（超宽带）技术的 `Nooploop <https://www.nooploop.com/en/>`__ 系统作为 GPS "
"的短距离替代方案，在室内实现 Loiter、PosHold、RTL、Auto 等位置控制飞行模式。"

