#: ../../source/docs/common-nooploop.rst:27 1bd652ad00614563bc5c9c20faaa386a
#: 47048235ece4498d952b2419e40996b1 4b074a94476942778ecba2912e7058aa
#: 780ba0cb5b694061a3e49f687225ff90 998b366d30e64c1c8e6711f022985394
msgid ""
"The anchors should be placed in a rectangular shape. Anchor 0 will act as "
"\"origin\" and Y axis of Nooploop system will act as \"North\". The "
"configuration is slightly simpler if the line from anchor 0 to anchor 1 is "
"due North but it is not required as the :ref:`BCN_ORIENT_YAW "
"<BCN_ORIENT_YAW>` parameter can be used to account this difference."
msgstr ""
"锚点应呈矩形摆放。锚点 0 作为「原点」，Nooploop 系统的 Y 轴作为「北」方向。若锚点 0 到锚点 1 "
"的连线正好指向正北则配置最为简便，但这并非必须，可通过 :ref:`BCN_ORIENT_YAW <BCN_ORIENT_YAW>` 参数补偿偏差。"

